{"3648430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Think and Choice", "steam_appid": 3648430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a casual board battle strategy game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking and decision-making, judgment and opportunity, you are the brain of the team, observing enemies, adjusting the team, planning actions, and commanding on the chessboard. You will seize the critical opportunity and defeat the strong enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the damage caused by characters is divided into ordinary damage and attribute damage. The attributes that cause damage are mainly composed of classic mutual restraint of water, fire, and grass. Of course, there are also some special derivative attributes (such as ice), and the restraint attribute can cause more damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the challenge mode, before entering the battle level, you have the opportunity to adjust your team and choose different gates to enter the battle. The choice of gates will affect the types and attributes of some enemies in the battle level, and may even lead to different environments. Choosing the door that is more advantageous to you can allow your team to leverage their strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1...Before the battle begins, the character's action route can be adjusted and command buttons can be bound. The character will act on different patrol routes according to commands during the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/a8212bb628929125833a52ae7f65183b.avif?t=1764993529\" width=239 height=330 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/755c3fd9e34bbf15496ec885fa62156c.avif?t=1764993529\" width=289 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/16b41cb53ee1ac593c92e7848ada05d7.poster.avif?t=1764993529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/16b41cb53ee1ac593c92e7848ada05d7.webm?t=1764993529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/16b41cb53ee1ac593c92e7848ada05d7.mp4?t=1764993529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2...Click the left mouse button to summon a false self on the map, who can only withstand one enemy damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/d2c7c548236c748c0d86cbc31ab49038.poster.avif?t=1764993529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/d2c7c548236c748c0d86cbc31ab49038.webm?t=1764993529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/d2c7c548236c748c0d86cbc31ab49038.mp4?t=1764993529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a casual board battle strategy game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking and decision-making, judgment and opportunity, you are the brain of the team, observing enemies, adjusting the team, planning actions, and commanding on the chessboard. You will seize the critical opportunity and defeat the strong enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the damage caused by characters is divided into ordinary damage and attribute damage. The attributes that cause damage are mainly composed of classic mutual restraint of water, fire, and grass. Of course, there are also some special derivative attributes (such as ice), and the restraint attribute can cause more damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the challenge mode, before entering the battle level, you have the opportunity to adjust your team and choose different gates to enter the battle. The choice of gates will affect the types and attributes of some enemies in the battle level, and may even lead to different environments. Choosing the door that is more advantageous to you can allow your team to leverage their strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1...Before the battle begins, the character's action route can be adjusted and command buttons can be bound. The character will act on different patrol routes according to commands during the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/a8212bb628929125833a52ae7f65183b.avif?t=1764993529\" width=239 height=330 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648430/extras/755c3fd9e34bbf15496ec885fa62156c.avif?t=1764993529\" width=289 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s